{"parentUuid":"e0692ca7-3e74-4e28-b79e-96530b47724d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e2f2347a-1108-43a3-bd48-b7723d8503fe","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L9VQN8YiXroR3cXsAfYd9A","type":"tool_result","content":"8:- `stops/tour.js` route order, room, level: single source for order and prev/next · `stops/<slug>/car.js` pure data (+ photo.jpg)\n17:- `tools/` build, vendor-three, fit-photo-camera (+ photo-fits/*.json) · `docs/TOUR-POC.md` (model maths §6), `docs/research.md`\n29:- car.js: `{ slug, title, name, year, summary, eyebrow, lede, frame?, ride?, orbit?, sun?, body?: { ghost }, photo?,\n32:  `{ layout({ active, onPhoto }), update(dt, { onPhoto }) }`. The shell owns switches, photo view, outline, ghost body and\n36:- Add a stop: entry in `stops/tour.js` + `stops/<slug>/car.js` (copy the closest sibling). Optional photo: 1200 px wide, CC\n37:  licence with credit, camera fitted with `node tools/fit-photo-camera.mjs tools/photo-fits/<slug>.json`. Tests find it via tour.js.\n47:Portrait and landscape · light and dark · orbit, pinch, sliders · photo overlay lines up with Car outline on · airplane mode\n51:## Open\n52:- Confirm on site: rooms and levels in tour.js (Collection 4 on level 4 is a guess; 220 S may be in Legend 4); which 540 K\n53:  is shown (Cabriolet B photo vs the 1938 Streamliner); which W 111 variant; whether the Popemobile has diff locks.\n54:- Still unsourced: 260 D compression ratio (20.5 : 1), Simplex gear count and ratios, Blitzen-Benz valve gear.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"6c62a4e9-dc89-4a51-823b-72507ba2991c","timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:21:57.723Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"8:- `stops/tour.js` route order, room, level: single source for order and prev/next · `stops/<slug>/car.js` pure data (+ photo.jpg)\n17:- `tools/` build, vendor-three, fit-photo-camera (+ photo-fits/*.json) · `docs/TOUR-POC.md` (model maths §6), `docs/research.md`\n29:- car.js: `{ slug, title, name, year, summary, eyebrow, lede, fr