-17T00:22:30.315Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"5d159ce6-986e-402a-8497-3efb23b3fb41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kunabel/workspace/MercedesExperience","sessionId":"5d159ce6-986e-402a-8497-3efb23b3fb41","version":"2.1.316","gitBranch":"main","slug":"i-want-to-make-misty-starfish"}
{"parentUuid":"f9f877ec-26cc-4919-8a24-d444d694d55f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7YbvmBPTw4ik1Hd7Z5J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Every stop now has the museum photo view: all 14 that lacked one, plus the 190 E and 540 K that already had it. The workflow actions are bumped too. Nothing is committed yet; shall I commit and push both together? Pushing deploys the site.\n\nUnit tests (85) and the e2e suite (73) pass. The e2e run now clicks Museum photo → Car outline → 3D model on every stop and confirms the portrait engine photo fits a landscape screen. I also screenshotted each stop in photo view with the outline on, and wheels, engines and radiators land on the real parts. The photos haven't been checked on a real iPhone or iPad yet.\n\n**Photos.** All are CC BY 2.0 from Wikimedia Commons, by Valder137 (museum visit, June 2013), except the Grandfather Clock engine, which is by Mohan S. Each page shows its credit and link. Commons rate-limited some downloads, so a few took retries.\n\n**How the overlays line up**\n- Each camera is fitted to wheel centres and tyre bottoms, plus headlamps where wheels were hidden. Most fits are within 5–12 px on a 1200 px photo.\n- The 260 D is the weak one: only one wheel is visible in any usable photo, so its overlay is approximate. That's noted on the page.\n- I traced the car outlines from the photos instead of guessing. On rounded cars (300 SLR, C 111) the outline is still roughly box-shaped, but it no longer overshoots badly.\n- In photo view the mechanisms behave as if the parked car were really there:\n  - opaque model wheels fade out so the real ones show through;\n  - the 300 SEL 6.3 body stays still while its air bellows work;\n  - the 220 S front folds back towards the cell instead of the car driving at a wall;\n  - aero hides its road markings.\n- The engine's flywheels are now see-through and its case is scaled to the photo, so you can watch the crank inside the real engine.\n\n**Corrections and findings**\n- **SSK wheelbase:** it was 2,400 mm and is really 2,950 mm, with a 1,425 mm track. The [Mercedes-Benz public archive](https://mercedes-benz-publicarchive.com/marsClassic/en/instance/ko/SSK-27180250-hp--WS-06-1929---1930.xhtml?oid=4181) and [Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercedes-Benz_SSK) agree. The overlay exposed it.\n- **Daimler van:** the museum's van is an open platform truck, not a box van. Its round radiator is at the front, so I moved the radiator and reworded one line.\n- **Popemobile:** the photo was taken in the \"Gallery of Celebrities\", which matches Collection 4 in the tour.\n- **Victoria:** the museum car in the photo is the Vis-à-Vis (a Victoria with a facing front seat).\n- **220 S:** the photo shows a 1964 220 S.\n\nThe last two are now open questions in CLAUDE.md and on the pages."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":800,"cache_read_input_tokens":360345,"output_tokens":1230,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":207},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":800,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1230,"cache_read_input_tokens":360345,"cache_creation_input_tokens":800,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":800},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.4.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.6.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.6.content.1","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.8.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.8.content.1","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.12.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.12.content.1","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.14.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.16.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.18.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.23.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.23.content.1","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.25.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.29.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.29.content.1","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.33.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.35.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.37.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.41.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.41.content.1","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.43.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.45.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.45.content.1","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.47.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped"