imler case; flywheels are see-through.\n- SSK wheelbase corrected to 2,950 mm (Mercedes-Benz archive); van radiator moved\n  to the front as photographed.\n- Workflow: upload-artifact v7, configure-pages v6, upload-pages-artifact v5,\n  deploy-pages v5.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1 && git push origin main 2>&1 | tail -2","description":"Commit the photo overlay work and push to main","timeout":120000}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_019zJgWLLNJ3nmfzmn8C9goR":{"cwd":"/Users/kunabel/workspace/MercedesExperience"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"754fc6eb-8f96-40f7-9e07-1a6853917c4a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch7YjTqeeyiJXHFTQKRXH","requestRef":"dc20929b-c89b-4777-bbd7-29fdddb07d81","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"3fd2cb4e-d7ba-420a-a064-77be682966bc","timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:24:10.179Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"5d159ce6-986e-402a-8497-3efb23b3fb41","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kunabel/workspace/MercedesExperience","sessionId":"5d159ce6-986e-402a-8497-3efb23b3fb41","version":"2.1.316","gitBranch":"main","slug":"i-want-to-make-misty-starfish"}
